          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri withum banja ri jowoti win, ŋey Were bende kilathumo riwin banja. Wikiri wirodhi jowoti win aka bende k'orodhi win. Cwaki win reco pa jowoti win aka bende ibino cwako mewin; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pok jowot win gigipiny, ŋey Were bino poko win bende. Rapor m'opoŋ, m'odile, m'oyengi to poŋ cuka oy; am'ibino ketho i cingi win. Kole rapor m'ioro ri jowotin ama Were bende bino oro ma kipima rin gine gima go dwoko rin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.6.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
